{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>Joni 是一款專為疲憊父母設計的簡潔嬰兒追蹤應用，幫助用戶輕鬆記錄寶寶的睡眠、餵食及換尿布情況。這款 App 目前正進行限時免費活動，讓新手爸媽能以最優惠的方式掌握育兒節奏，減少手動記錄的時間壓力。</p>\n\n<h2>智能預測與隱私保護</h2>\n<p>Joni 採用極簡介面，支援單手快速操作，完美適應深夜育兒場景。它能自動分析數據並預測下次睡眠或餵食時間，提供信心指數參考。所有資料均本地存儲，無需註冊帳號且無廣告干擾，確保寶寶隱私安全。App 還具備主螢幕小部件及即時動態功能，讓家長隨時一目了然地檢視今日總覽與歷史記錄，提升育兒效率。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1284x2778bb-741-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1284x2778bb-742-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1284x2778bb-743-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1284x2778bb-744-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1284x2778bb-745-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：Joni – Baby Tracker (4d761d)</li>\n<li>應用類別：Lifestyle</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-31T15:59:07.020395+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":319,"images":5,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none"}}